// LEARNING-RECORD §6 v2 — the tool.execute.after hook fires for EVERY
// tool (write, edit, read, bash, grep, websearch…), not just .vsm
// writes. The CLASSIFY plugin's context filtered (return {}) but the
// socratic shell STILL evaluated the tree with an empty docType and
// STILL called act → printed "opina sin certificar (R10)" for any read
// of a .vsm or any bash call with a .vsm path in args. The activation
// log (logs/agent_plugin.jsonl) proved it was REAL events, not replay.

